      "writtenOn": "2024-06-04T09:08:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With and without leaudioBroadcastExtractPeriodicScannerFromStateMachine it will works in the same way.\n\nupdatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap is called twice:\nIn selectSource/handleSelectSourceRequest:\n```\nupdatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap(\n        scanRes.getDevice(),\n        scanRes.getDevice().getAddressType(),\n        BassConstants.INVALID_SYNC_HANDLE,\n        BassConstants.INVALID_ADV_SID,\n        scanRes.getPeriodicAdvertisingInterval(),\n        broadcastId,\n        pbData,\n        broadcastName);\n```\nHere syncHandle is always invalid so mSyncHandleToDeviceMap.put(syncHandle, device); will be never called.\n\n                \nIn onSyncEstablished:\n```\nupdatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap(\n        device,\n        BassConstants.INVALID_ADV_ADDRESS_TYPE,\n        syncHandle,\n        advertisingSid,\n        BassConstants.INVALID_ADV_INTERVAL,\n        BassConstants.INVALID_BROADCAST_ID,\n        null,\n        null);\n```\nHere syncHandle is always valid and broadcastId is always invalid so mSyncHandleToDeviceMap.put(syncHandle, device); will be always called.",
      "parentUuid": "5e2c170e_2968705e",
      "revId": "40c70e37fe27ce42b7eda65a13069e02d11697d7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
