      "writtenOn": "2024-06-04T10:10:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With flag there is need to update it later to make possible correctly remove all information in line #336 (syncHandle has to point to old device).\n\nIMHO for any other reason there is no difference where it will be. Cases from #350 and #319 are barely possible but even so if we return there we do not update any other things like updateSyncHandleForBroadcastId.\n\ngetDeviceForSyncHandle is used in onBigInfoAdvertisingReport. In old code if we update deviceForSyncHandle but not syncHandleForBroadcastId then we return in `log(\"No PA record found\");` instead of `log(\"No device found.\");, so result will be the same.\n\nAnother usage of getDeviceForSyncHandle in old code is in parseBaseData when mAutoTriggered is true which we proved that is not needed at all.\n\nLast thing is that BASS in old code is not reliable at all so I could not imagine that it will be released without my changes:)",
